 AC-Bu. The song is included on the album, \"Juice B Crypts\".\n<br><br>\nIn 2020, the outbreak of Covid-19 caused a global lockdown and restricted many activities and events in the world. This music video depicts the ’Great Space Robot Festival’ that unfolds to avenge cancelled festivals and events, in the hope that humanity will be able to overcome the crisis and move towards a better world.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Youtube video description)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Mecha"], "tags": [{"name": "Space", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 136855, "title": {"romaji": "Tokimeki", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video directed by Takaharu Shimizu for the single Tokimeki by Japanese band yonawo.", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 136866, "title": {"romaji": "DERO", "english": "DERO"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video directed and animated by bobibobi for the song <i>DERO</i> by DUSTCELL.", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Demons", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 136950, "title": {"romaji": "XPICE", "english": "XPICE"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "<i>Find your spice. Live true to you.</i> <br><br>\nA collaboration between all-female rock band SCANDAL x the company XFLAG, an original animated short: <i>XPICE</i>—a tale of heroes fighting to protect their city, and how they grow along the way. It's got a dash of courage, a pinch of teamwork, and a whole lot of heart. The short is directed by Tsubasa Nakai set to the song <i>Spice</i> by SCANDAL. <br> <br>\n\nKokyo, a city brimming with people from all walks of life, and the prime target of the mysterious group Zerogram. But Red Pepper and Wasabi—a duo from the superhero league XPICE—aren't going to stand idly by.\n\nRed Pepper's fiery punches deal with the baddies while Wasabi's healing touch cares for the wounded. Things seem to be going well on the surface. Deep down, however, Wasabi can't help but feel like there's more to being a hero.\n\nOne faithful day, the emergency alert blares—Red Pepper's in trouble!\n\nThough unsure of their chances, seeing a teammate in danger helps Wasabi find the courage to rise to the occasion.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official Site, edited)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2020, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#XPICE", "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Music"], "tags": [{"name": "Superhero", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cyberpunk", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Super Power", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 137126, "title": {"romaji": "Alba", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for Keina Suda's single <i>Alba</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 137182, "title": {"romaji": "Citrus (Music)", "english": "Citrus (Music)"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video by Ta